paigns can focus on listing consultations and local market information. Each requires different messaging, qualification and follow-up."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can Google Ads work for real estate agents?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Google Ads can capture active demand when targeting, budgets and landing pages align with a specific market. Measure qualified conversations rather than clicks alone."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can you advertise listings on Facebook and Instagram?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, where the advertiser has the required rights and permissions. Housing campaigns must comply with Meta's Special Ad Category rules and applicable fair housing laws."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will you connect leads to our existing CRM?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We assess the brokerage's current CRM and lead-routing process first, then plan supported integrations, follow-up ownership and appointment workflows."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you guarantee listings or closed deals?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Marketing can improve how relevant inquiries are attracted and handled, but appointments, listings and transactions depend on multiple factors outside advertising."}}]}]};
